              <calculation class='tableau' formula='//schrikkeljaar: 29 feb 2024 is an extra day&#13;&#10;//however....I dont think we need a &apos;schrikkeljaar&apos;-solution&#13;&#10;//if there is an extra date (29 feb &apos;24), it does not add an extra weekday &#13;&#10;//364/7 = 52&#13;&#10;//ind_schrikkeljaar&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;    [Calculation_1567252717417353216]&lt;=[Parameters].[Parameter 1]-364&#13;&#10;    and [Calculation_1567252717417353216]&gt;=[Parameters].[Parameter 1]-364' />
